@startuml Order_Creation_Sequence
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Passenger App" as App
participant "API Gateway (Envoy)" as GW
participant "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "Routing / Map Engine" as MapSvc
participant "Pricing & Surge Service" as SurgeSvc
participant "Billing Service" as BillSvc
participant "PSP (Stripe / Adyen)" as PSP
database "PostgreSQL Core DB" as DB
queue "Kafka (order.events)" as Kafka

== Step 1: Request Route & Price Estimate ==
App -> GW: POST /api/v1/rides/estimate\n{pickup_lat/lon, dest_lat/lon, tariff_class}
GW -> SurgeSvc: Request Route & Price Quote
SurgeSvc -> MapSvc: Get Distance & Duration Matrix (OSRM)
MapSvc --> SurgeSvc: Distance: 8.4 km, Duration: 18 min
SurgeSvc -> SurgeSvc: Lookup H3 Res 7 Cell Surge Multiplier (1.4x)
SurgeSvc -> SurgeSvc: Calculate Base + (km * rate) + (min * rate) * Surge
SurgeSvc --> GW: Price: $18.50, Token: "quote_tok_991823", TTL: 120s
GW --> App: Return Estimate ($18.50) & Route Polyline

== Step 2: Confirm Booking & Place Pre-Auth Hold ==
App -> GW: POST /api/v1/rides/create\n{quote_token, payment_method_id, idempotency_key}
GW -> OrderSvc: CreateRide(CreateRideRequest)

OrderSvc -> SurgeSvc: Validate Quote Token & Expiry
SurgeSvc --> OrderSvc: Token Valid (Amount: $18.50)

OrderSvc -> BillSvc: PreAuthorizeHold(userId, $18.50 * 1.15 = $21.28)
BillSvc -> PSP: Auth Hold Request ($21.28)
PSP --> BillSvc: Auth Succeeded (psp_hold_id: "ch_3N198")
BillSvc --> OrderSvc: Hold Confirmed

OrderSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO rides (status='REQUESTED', ...)
DB --> OrderSvc: ride_id = "ride_77218"

OrderSvc -> Kafka: Publish(topic: "order.lifecycle.events", key: "ride_77218", type: "ORDER_REQUESTED")
OrderSvc --> GW: 201 Created {ride_id: "ride_77218", status: "MATCHING"}
GW --> App: 201 Created (Transition UI to Searching Radar)

@enduml
